(window.XZ_MANUAL_CHAPTERS=window.XZ_MANUAL_CHAPTERS||{})["extras"]="<header class=\"mc-head\"><p class=\"mc-eyebrow\">MODS menu<\/p><h2 class=\"mc-title\" tabindex=\"-1\">Extras<\/h2><p class=\"mc-lede\">Games, USB apps, reporting a problem and the About page.<\/p><p class=\"applies\" data-applies=\"both\">Applies to <b>MODERN and CLASSIC<\/b><\/p><\/header><p>EXTRAS holds what is not about playing a set: games, apps from a USB, reporting a problem, the About page and the language of the MODS menu. Nothing here starts on its own. The XZ always starts in its normal DJ view, and a game or app opens only when you choose it.<\/p>\n<p>Open MODS with <span class=\"xzb\" data-key=\"menu\"><img class=\"xzb-g\" src=\"assets/buttons/menu.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"60.86\" height=\"32\"><span class=\"xzb-n\">MENU<\/span><\/span>, then choose <strong>EXTRAS<\/strong> in the section rail.<\/p>\n<h3 id=\"m-the-extras-page\" data-anchor=\"the-extras-page\">The EXTRAS page<\/h3>\n<div class=\"mn\" data-iface=\"modern\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"The EXTRAS page\"><ol class=\"mn-scenes\"><li data-flow=\"mods-extras\" data-video=\"assets/manual/nav/mods-extras.mp4\" data-poster=\"assets/manual/nav/mods-extras.webp\" data-w=\"1280\" data-h=\"480\" data-seconds=\"3.632\" data-title=\"The EXTRAS page\"><ol class=\"mn-steps\"><li data-t=\"500\">Press <span class=\"xzb\" data-key=\"menu\"><img class=\"xzb-g\" src=\"assets/buttons/menu.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"60.86\" height=\"32\"><span class=\"xzb-n\">MENU<\/span><\/span><\/li><li data-t=\"1000\">Tap <strong>EXTRAS<\/strong><\/li><li data-t=\"1520\">Turn <span class=\"xzb\" data-key=\"rotary\"><img class=\"xzb-g\" src=\"assets/buttons/rotary.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"33\" height=\"32\"><span class=\"xzb-n\">ROTARY SELECTOR<\/span><\/span> 3 clicks clockwise<\/li><li data-t=\"2120\">Press <span class=\"xzb\" data-key=\"back\"><img class=\"xzb-g\" src=\"assets/buttons/back.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"76.49\" height=\"32\"><span class=\"xzb-n\">BACK<\/span><\/span><\/li><\/ol><\/li><\/ol><\/div>\n<figure class=\"mf\" id=\"f-extras-1\"><div class=\"mf-frame\"><div class=\"mf-bar\"><span class=\"mf-label\">MODS · EXTRAS<\/span><\/div><div class=\"mf-stage\"><img src=\"manual/shots/06e1d9256b631af2.webp\" width=\"800\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"The parts of EXTRAS.\" data-iface=\"modern\"><img src=\"manual/shots/16e5bef76f1d3a51.webp\" width=\"800\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"The parts of EXTRAS.\" data-iface=\"classic\"><span class=\"mf-spot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/span><div class=\"mf-marks\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Numbered points on the picture\"><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"1\" data-x=\"28.750\" data-y=\"18.333\" aria-label=\"1: GAMES\" aria-describedby=\"f-extras-1-1\">1<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"2\" data-x=\"70.000\" data-y=\"18.333\" aria-label=\"2: USB APPS\" aria-describedby=\"f-extras-1-2\">2<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"3\" data-x=\"28.750\" data-y=\"55.417\" aria-label=\"3: REPORT AN ISSUE\" aria-describedby=\"f-extras-1-3\">3<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"4\" data-x=\"70.000\" data-y=\"55.417\" aria-label=\"4: ABOUT XZ MODS\" aria-describedby=\"f-extras-1-4\">4<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"5\" data-x=\"10.625\" data-y=\"88.542\" aria-label=\"5: Dock\" aria-describedby=\"f-extras-1-5\">5<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"6\" data-x=\"37.500\" data-y=\"79.583\" aria-label=\"6: LANGUAGE\" aria-describedby=\"f-extras-1-6\">6<\/button><\/div><\/div><\/div><figcaption>The parts of EXTRAS.<\/figcaption><ol class=\"mf-legend\" aria-label=\"What the numbers show\"><li data-n=\"1\" id=\"f-extras-1-1\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><div><b>GAMES<\/b> <span>Doom and Chex Quest, Beat Arcade, Wave Rider, Rhythm Lab and Static Surfer.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"2\" id=\"f-extras-1-2\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><div><b>USB APPS<\/b> <span>XZ SDK apps from a USB.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"3\" id=\"f-extras-1-3\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><div><b>REPORT AN ISSUE<\/b> <span>Send a problem, a question or an idea from the player.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"4\" id=\"f-extras-1-4\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><div><b>ABOUT XZ MODS<\/b> <span>Credits, links and support.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"5\" id=\"f-extras-1-5\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><div><b>Dock<\/b> <span>Explains the highlighted card. For GAMES it reminds you that audio keeps playing.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"6\" id=\"f-extras-1-6\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6<\/span><div><b>LANGUAGE<\/b> <span>The language of the MODS menu on the player.<\/span><\/div><\/li><\/ol><\/figure>\n<p>The HOME card for EXTRAS counts the games and the apps found on your USBs, for example <strong>6 games | no USB apps<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<h3 id=\"m-games\" data-anchor=\"games\">Games<\/h3>\n<p>Every game runs on the XZ itself. The music keeps playing while you play, and PLAY and track search keep their normal jobs in Beat Arcade. Doom and Beat Arcade make no sound of their own.<\/p>\n<div class=\"mn\" data-iface=\"modern\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Games\"><ol class=\"mn-scenes\"><li data-flow=\"games\" data-video=\"assets/manual/nav/games.mp4\" data-poster=\"assets/manual/nav/games.webp\" data-w=\"1280\" data-h=\"480\" data-seconds=\"3.452\" data-title=\"Games\"><ol class=\"mn-steps\"><li data-t=\"500\">Press <span class=\"xzb\" data-key=\"menu\"><img class=\"xzb-g\" src=\"assets/buttons/menu.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"60.86\" height=\"32\"><span class=\"xzb-n\">MENU<\/span><\/span><\/li><li data-t=\"1000\">Tap <strong>EXTRAS<\/strong><\/li><li data-t=\"1520\">Tap <strong>GAMES<\/strong><\/li><li data-t=\"2040\">Turn <span class=\"xzb\" data-key=\"rotary\"><img class=\"xzb-g\" src=\"assets/buttons/rotary.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"33\" height=\"32\"><span class=\"xzb-n\">ROTARY SELECTOR<\/span><\/span> 2 clicks clockwise<\/li><\/ol><\/li><\/ol><\/div>\n<figure class=\"mf\" id=\"f-extras-2\"><div class=\"mf-frame\"><div class=\"mf-bar\"><span class=\"mf-label\">MODS · GAMES<\/span><\/div><div class=\"mf-stage\"><img src=\"manual/shots/dfd79a0d083646c4.webp\" width=\"800\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Every game, plus USB WAD LOADER and MY HOUSE / SETUP.\" data-iface=\"modern\"><img src=\"manual/shots/db883eb785b75d0b.webp\" width=\"800\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Every game, plus USB WAD LOADER and MY HOUSE / SETUP.\" data-iface=\"classic\"><span class=\"mf-spot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/span><div class=\"mf-marks\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Numbered points on the picture\"><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"1\" data-x=\"51.250\" data-y=\"14.167\" aria-label=\"1: DOOM / CHOOSE WAD\" aria-describedby=\"f-extras-2-1\">1<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"2\" data-x=\"87.500\" data-y=\"14.167\" aria-label=\"2: CHEX QUEST\" aria-describedby=\"f-extras-2-2\">2<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"3\" data-x=\"51.250\" data-y=\"32.500\" aria-label=\"3: BEAT ARCADE\" aria-describedby=\"f-extras-2-3\">3<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"4\" data-x=\"87.500\" data-y=\"32.500\" aria-label=\"4: WAVE RIDER\" aria-describedby=\"f-extras-2-4\">4<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"5\" data-x=\"51.250\" data-y=\"50.833\" aria-label=\"5: USB WAD LOADER\" aria-describedby=\"f-extras-2-5\">5<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"6\" data-x=\"90.000\" data-y=\"50.833\" aria-label=\"6: MY HOUSE / SETUP\" aria-describedby=\"f-extras-2-6\">6<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"7\" data-x=\"53.125\" data-y=\"66.667\" aria-label=\"7: RHYTHM LAB / 10 STUDIES\" aria-describedby=\"f-extras-2-7\">7<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"8\" data-x=\"88.750\" data-y=\"69.167\" aria-label=\"8: STATIC SURFER\" aria-describedby=\"f-extras-2-8\">8<\/button><\/div><\/div><\/div><figcaption>Every game, plus USB WAD LOADER and MY HOUSE / SETUP.<\/figcaption><ol class=\"mf-legend\" aria-label=\"What the numbers show\"><li data-n=\"1\" id=\"f-extras-2-1\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><div><b>DOOM / CHOOSE WAD<\/b> <span>Classic Doom or Doom II. Choose the game files next.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"2\" id=\"f-extras-2-2\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><div><b>CHEX QUEST<\/b> <span>The original Chex Quest.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"3\" id=\"f-extras-2-3\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><div><b>BEAT ARCADE<\/b> <span>Pong and Breakout scored on the beat, played with the jog.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"4\" id=\"f-extras-2-4\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><div><b>WAVE RIDER<\/b> <span>Surf the playing track's waveform with the jog.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"5\" id=\"f-extras-2-5\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><div><b>USB WAD LOADER<\/b> <span>Choose a Doom base game and an optional add-on from the USB.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"6\" id=\"f-extras-2-6\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6<\/span><div><b>MY HOUSE / SETUP<\/b> <span>Checks for the engine the My House mod needs.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"7\" id=\"f-extras-2-7\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7<\/span><div><b>RHYTHM LAB / 10 STUDIES<\/b> <span>Ten short rhythm studies played on the pads.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"8\" id=\"f-extras-2-8\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8<\/span><div><b>STATIC SURFER<\/b> <span>A runner game set to the playing track.<\/span><\/div><\/li><\/ol><\/figure>\n<div class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Game<\/th><th>What it is<\/th><th>Needs<\/th><\/tr><\/thead><tbody><tr><td>Beat Arcade <span class=\"tag tag--experimental\">experimental<\/span><\/td><td>Solo Pong, Pong Duel on both jogs, Solo Breaks and a two-player Breakout. Tap CUE on the beat to build charge<\/td><td>Nothing. Built in<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Wave Rider <span class=\"tag tag--experimental\">experimental<\/span><\/td><td>The loaded track's waveform becomes hills. Steer with the jog, hold <span class=\"xzb\" data-key=\"cue\"><img class=\"xzb-g\" src=\"assets/buttons/cue.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"69.63\" height=\"32\"><span class=\"xzb-n\">CUE<\/span><\/span> to add weight. Solo, Co-op or Versus<\/td><td>Nothing. Built in<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Rhythm Lab<\/td><td>Ten short rhythm studies for the jogs and pads. They are prototypes, and you can rate each one<\/td><td>Nothing. Built in<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Static Surfer<\/td><td>A rhythm platformer. Tap to jump and tilt the jog to pass through the glyphs<\/td><td>Nothing. Built in<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Doom<\/td><td>Classic Doom or Doom II<\/td><td>Game files on the USB<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Chex Quest<\/td><td>The original Chex Quest<\/td><td>Game files on the USB<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/div>\n<h4 id=\"m-moving-around-a-game\" data-anchor=\"moving-around-a-game\">Moving around a game<\/h4>\n<p>You do not need the touchscreen in any game.<\/p>\n<div class=\"mn\" data-iface=\"modern\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Moving around a game\"><ol class=\"mn-scenes\"><li data-flow=\"b-rider\" data-video=\"assets/manual/nav/b-rider.mp4\" data-poster=\"assets/manual/nav/b-rider.webp\" data-w=\"1280\" data-h=\"480\" data-seconds=\"7.212\" data-title=\"Moving around a game\"><ol class=\"mn-steps\"><li data-t=\"500\">Press <span class=\"xzb\" data-key=\"menu\"><img class=\"xzb-g\" src=\"assets/buttons/menu.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"60.86\" height=\"32\"><span class=\"xzb-n\">MENU<\/span><\/span><\/li><li data-t=\"1000\">Tap <strong>EXTRAS<\/strong><\/li><li data-t=\"1520\">Tap <strong>GAMES<\/strong><\/li><li data-t=\"2040\">Tap <strong>WAVE RIDER<\/strong><\/li><li data-t=\"2560\">Turn <span class=\"xzb\" data-key=\"rotary\"><img class=\"xzb-g\" src=\"assets/buttons/rotary.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"33\" height=\"32\"><span class=\"xzb-n\">ROTARY SELECTOR<\/span><\/span> 1 click clockwise, then push it<\/li><li data-t=\"3260\">Push <span class=\"xzb\" data-key=\"rotary\"><img class=\"xzb-g\" src=\"assets/buttons/rotary.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"33\" height=\"32\"><span class=\"xzb-n\">ROTARY SELECTOR<\/span><\/span><\/li><li data-t=\"3760\">Push <span class=\"xzb\" data-key=\"rotary\"><img class=\"xzb-g\" src=\"assets/buttons/rotary.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"33\" height=\"32\"><span class=\"xzb-n\">ROTARY SELECTOR<\/span><\/span><\/li><li data-t=\"4260\">Turn the left jog wheel<\/li><li data-t=\"4440\">Turn <span class=\"xzb\" data-key=\"rotary\"><img class=\"xzb-g\" src=\"assets/buttons/rotary.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"33\" height=\"32\"><span class=\"xzb-n\">ROTARY SELECTOR<\/span><\/span> 1 click clockwise, then push it<\/li><li data-t=\"5140\">Press <span class=\"xzb\" data-key=\"cue\"><img class=\"xzb-g\" src=\"assets/buttons/cue.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"69.63\" height=\"32\"><span class=\"xzb-n\">CUE<\/span><\/span> on the left deck<\/li><li data-t=\"5320\">Turn the left jog wheel<\/li><li data-t=\"5680\">Tap the screen<\/li><\/ol><\/li><\/ol><\/div>\n<div class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Control<\/th><th>In a game<\/th><\/tr><\/thead><tbody><tr><td>Turn the encoder<\/td><td>Moves a ring over the controls on the screen<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Push the encoder<\/td><td>Presses the control under the ring<\/td><\/tr><tr><td><span class=\"xzb\" data-key=\"back\"><img class=\"xzb-g\" src=\"assets/buttons/back.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"76.49\" height=\"32\"><span class=\"xzb-n\">BACK<\/span><\/span><\/td><td>Steps back<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Touch<\/td><td>Presses what you touch. The ring hides until you turn the encoder again<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/div>\n<h4 id=\"m-beat-arcade\" data-anchor=\"beat-arcade\">Beat Arcade <span class=\"tag tag--experimental\">experimental<\/span><\/h4>\n<p>Turn the jog to move your paddle and tap <strong>CUE<\/strong> on each beat as the moving light meets the target. Good notes build charge. Eight good notes in a row earn a shield, and sixteen build a Drop that fires on the next downbeat.<\/p>\n<div class=\"mn\" data-iface=\"modern\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Beat Arcade\"><ol class=\"mn-scenes\"><li data-flow=\"b-arcade\" data-video=\"assets/manual/nav/b-arcade.mp4\" data-poster=\"assets/manual/nav/b-arcade.webp\" data-w=\"1280\" data-h=\"480\" data-seconds=\"6.032\" data-title=\"Beat Arcade\"><ol class=\"mn-steps\"><li data-t=\"500\">Press <span class=\"xzb\" data-key=\"menu\"><img class=\"xzb-g\" src=\"assets/buttons/menu.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"60.86\" height=\"32\"><span class=\"xzb-n\">MENU<\/span><\/span><\/li><li data-t=\"1000\">Tap <strong>EXTRAS<\/strong><\/li><li data-t=\"1520\">Tap <strong>GAMES<\/strong><\/li><li data-t=\"2040\">Tap <strong>BEAT ARCADE<\/strong><\/li><li data-t=\"2560\">Turn <span class=\"xzb\" data-key=\"rotary\"><img class=\"xzb-g\" src=\"assets/buttons/rotary.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"33\" height=\"32\"><span class=\"xzb-n\">ROTARY SELECTOR<\/span><\/span> 1 click clockwise, then push it<\/li><li data-t=\"3260\">Turn the left jog wheel<\/li><li data-t=\"3440\">Press <span class=\"xzb\" data-key=\"cue\"><img class=\"xzb-g\" src=\"assets/buttons/cue.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"69.63\" height=\"32\"><span class=\"xzb-n\">CUE<\/span><\/span> on the left deck<\/li><li data-t=\"3800\">Press pad G on the left deck<\/li><li data-t=\"3980\">Tap the screen<\/li><li data-t=\"4500\">Tap the screen<\/li><\/ol><\/li><\/ol><\/div>\n<div class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Control<\/th><th>Action<\/th><\/tr><\/thead><tbody><tr><td>Jog<\/td><td>Moves the paddle. In the menu, chooses a game<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>CUE or pad A<\/td><td>Strikes on the beat. Starts, resumes and rematches<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Pad B<\/td><td>Wide paddle for 16 beats<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Pad C<\/td><td>Saves one miss with a shield<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Pad D<\/td><td>Queues a Drop on the next downbeat<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Pads E and F<\/td><td>Aim the next return<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Pad G<\/td><td>Changes the scene between Tunnel, Grid and Orbit<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Pad H<\/td><td>Lines up with the mixer tempo, or taps a tempo<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>PLAY, track search<\/td><td>Work as usual on the music<\/td><\/tr><tr><td><strong>DJ VIEW<\/strong> on screen<\/td><td>Saves the round and gives every control back to the deck<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/div>\n<p>Tap the source display at the top of the game to choose where the beat comes from: an analysed USB track, Pro DJ Link, the mixer tempo or four taps on pad H. For mixer tempo, set Beat FX to the channel you play, usually MASTER, and use AUTO BPM.<\/p>\n<p>While Beat Arcade runs, touching the platter does not pause or scratch the music. Choose DJ VIEW before you go back to mixing.<\/p>\n<h4 id=\"m-wave-rider\" data-anchor=\"wave-rider\">Wave Rider <span class=\"tag tag--experimental\">experimental<\/span><\/h4>\n<p>Choose <strong>Solo<\/strong>, <strong>Co-op<\/strong> or <strong>Versus<\/strong>, then the deck whose track you ride. In Solo that deck's jog steers. With two players, the left jog is player 1 and the right jog is player 2.<\/p>\n<ul><li>Hold <strong>CUE<\/strong> or a top-row pad to add weight and gain speed downhill. Let go as the ground rises, and the crest throws you into the air.<\/li><li>Turn the jog to tilt the board. Clockwise points the nose down.<\/li><li>Land with the slope to keep your speed. Clean landings in a row score more.<\/li><li><strong>EASY<\/strong> is the default and keeps the angle you set in the air. <strong>NORMAL<\/strong> and <strong>HARD<\/strong> are stricter.<\/li><\/ul>\n<p>A missed landing never stops the music.<\/p>\n<h4 id=\"m-doom-and-chex-quest\" data-anchor=\"doom-and-chex-quest\">Doom and Chex Quest<\/h4>\n<p>Doom and Chex Quest need game files on the USB. The XZ Mods app can download and check free Doom shareware, Chex Quest and Freedoom data when you prepare the USB. For the full Doom or Doom II you supply your own files. See <a class=\"m-link\" href=\"#manual\" data-chapter=\"desktop-app\">The XZ Mods app<\/a>.<\/p>\n<div class=\"mn\" data-iface=\"modern\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Doom and Chex Quest\"><ol class=\"mn-scenes\"><li data-flow=\"wad-loader\" data-video=\"assets/manual/nav/wad-loader.mp4\" data-poster=\"assets/manual/nav/wad-loader.webp\" data-w=\"1280\" data-h=\"480\" data-seconds=\"3.772\" data-title=\"Doom and Chex Quest\"><ol class=\"mn-steps\"><li data-t=\"500\">Press <span class=\"xzb\" data-key=\"menu\"><img class=\"xzb-g\" src=\"assets/buttons/menu.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"60.86\" height=\"32\"><span class=\"xzb-n\">MENU<\/span><\/span><\/li><li data-t=\"1000\">Tap <strong>EXTRAS<\/strong><\/li><li data-t=\"1520\">Tap <strong>GAMES<\/strong><\/li><li data-t=\"2040\">Tap <strong>USB WAD LOADER<\/strong><\/li><li data-t=\"2560\">Turn <span class=\"xzb\" data-key=\"rotary\"><img class=\"xzb-g\" src=\"assets/buttons/rotary.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"33\" height=\"32\"><span class=\"xzb-n\">ROTARY SELECTOR<\/span><\/span> 1 click clockwise<\/li><\/ol><\/li><\/ol><\/div>\n<figure class=\"mf\" id=\"f-extras-3\"><div class=\"mf-frame\"><div class=\"mf-bar\"><span class=\"mf-label\">DOOM<\/span><\/div><div class=\"mf-stage\"><img src=\"manual/shots/c5bf73d8e545d276.webp\" width=\"800\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"The Doom page before its game files have been checked.\" data-iface=\"modern\"><img src=\"manual/shots/05625fd118a38b1b.webp\" width=\"800\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"The Doom page before its game files have been checked.\" data-iface=\"classic\"><span class=\"mf-spot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/span><div class=\"mf-marks\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Numbered points on the picture\"><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"1\" data-x=\"34.375\" data-y=\"17.083\" aria-label=\"1: Status\" aria-describedby=\"f-extras-3-1\">1<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"2\" data-x=\"56.250\" data-y=\"30.208\" aria-label=\"2: Controls\" aria-describedby=\"f-extras-3-2\">2<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"3\" data-x=\"50.000\" data-y=\"51.250\" aria-label=\"3: Notes\" aria-describedby=\"f-extras-3-3\">3<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"4\" data-x=\"50.000\" data-y=\"72.500\" aria-label=\"4: SET UP DOOM\" aria-describedby=\"f-extras-3-4\">4<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"5\" data-x=\"81.250\" data-y=\"70.000\" aria-label=\"5: USB WADS\" aria-describedby=\"f-extras-3-5\">5<\/button><\/div><\/div><\/div><figcaption>The Doom page before its game files have been checked.<\/figcaption><ol class=\"mf-legend\" aria-label=\"What the numbers show\"><li data-n=\"1\" id=\"f-extras-3-1\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><div><b>Status<\/b> <span>USB GAME SETUP NEEDED until the files and engine have been checked.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"2\" id=\"f-extras-3-2\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><div><b>Controls<\/b> <span>What each control does while the game is open.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"3\" id=\"f-extras-3-3\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><div><b>Notes<\/b> <span>The buttons belong to the game while it is open. Exit gives back the DJ screen. Game sound is off.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"4\" id=\"f-extras-3-4\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><div><b>SET UP DOOM<\/b> <span>Reads START DOOM once setup is done. Starts the game full screen. DJ audio keeps playing.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"5\" id=\"f-extras-3-5\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><div><b>USB WADS<\/b> <span>Opens USB WAD LOADER to choose the game files.<\/span><\/div><\/li><\/ol><\/figure>\n<div class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>Player control<\/th><th>In Doom<\/th><\/tr><\/thead><tbody><tr><td>Jog<\/td><td>Turn left or right<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>PLAY, or pad A<\/td><td>Walk forward<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Pad B<\/td><td>Walk back<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>CUE, or pad C<\/td><td>Shoot<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Pad D<\/td><td>Use, for example open a door<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Pads E and F<\/td><td>Strafe<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Pad G<\/td><td>Enter<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Pad H, or <span class=\"xzb\" data-key=\"back\"><img class=\"xzb-g\" src=\"assets/buttons/back.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"76.49\" height=\"32\"><span class=\"xzb-n\">BACK<\/span><\/span><\/td><td>Game menu<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Turn and push the encoder<\/td><td>Moves through the game menu and enters<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/div>\n<p>To end the game, touch <strong>EXIT<\/strong>. The player goes back to the screen you had before.<\/p>\n<figure class=\"mf\" id=\"f-extras-4\"><div class=\"mf-frame\"><div class=\"mf-bar\"><span class=\"mf-label\">GAME SETUP<\/span><\/div><div class=\"mf-stage\"><img src=\"manual/shots/06076fbe1b255e32.webp\" width=\"800\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"The three setup steps for Doom.\" data-iface=\"modern\"><img src=\"manual/shots/36894e3ba22764d4.webp\" width=\"800\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"The three setup steps for Doom.\" data-iface=\"classic\"><span class=\"mf-spot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/span><div class=\"mf-marks\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Numbered points on the picture\"><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"1\" data-x=\"52.500\" data-y=\"26.042\" aria-label=\"1: Steps\" aria-describedby=\"f-extras-4-1\">1<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"2\" data-x=\"41.250\" data-y=\"29.792\" aria-label=\"2: Where the files go\" aria-describedby=\"f-extras-4-2\">2<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"3\" data-x=\"45.625\" data-y=\"42.500\" aria-label=\"3: The XZ Mods app\" aria-describedby=\"f-extras-4-3\">3<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"4\" data-x=\"62.500\" data-y=\"54.167\" aria-label=\"4: CHOOSE USB GAME FILES\" aria-describedby=\"f-extras-4-4\">4<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"5\" data-x=\"55.000\" data-y=\"74.167\" aria-label=\"5: BACK TO DOOM\" aria-describedby=\"f-extras-4-5\">5<\/button><\/div><\/div><\/div><figcaption>The three setup steps for Doom.<\/figcaption><ol class=\"mf-legend\" aria-label=\"What the numbers show\"><li data-n=\"1\" id=\"f-extras-4-1\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><div><b>Steps<\/b> <span>Find the Doom engine on the USB loader, choose a base game and optional map, then start Doom to check.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"2\" id=\"f-extras-4-2\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><div><b>Where the files go<\/b> <span>A WADS or VJTOOLS/DOOM folder on the USB.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"3\" id=\"f-extras-4-3\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><div><b>The XZ Mods app<\/b> <span>Prepares a Doom USB for you.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"4\" id=\"f-extras-4-4\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><div><b>CHOOSE USB GAME FILES<\/b> <span>Opens USB WAD LOADER.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"5\" id=\"f-extras-4-5\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><div><b>BACK TO DOOM<\/b> <span>Returns to the Doom page.<\/span><\/div><\/li><\/ol><\/figure>\n<figure class=\"mf\" id=\"f-extras-5\"><div class=\"mf-frame\"><div class=\"mf-bar\"><span class=\"mf-label\">USB WAD LOADER<\/span><\/div><div class=\"mf-stage\"><img src=\"manual/shots/148aab95119af5c2.webp\" width=\"800\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"The loader with no game files found yet.\" data-iface=\"modern\"><img src=\"manual/shots/64de8b3d84475f97.webp\" width=\"800\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"The loader with no game files found yet.\" data-iface=\"classic\"><span class=\"mf-spot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/span><div class=\"mf-marks\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Numbered points on the picture\"><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"1\" data-x=\"58.125\" data-y=\"34.792\" aria-label=\"1: File list\" aria-describedby=\"f-extras-5-1\">1<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"2\" data-x=\"21.875\" data-y=\"73.333\" aria-label=\"2: PREV and NEXT\" aria-describedby=\"f-extras-5-2\">2<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"3\" data-x=\"47.500\" data-y=\"73.333\" aria-label=\"3: RESCAN USB\" aria-describedby=\"f-extras-5-3\">3<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"4\" data-x=\"68.125\" data-y=\"73.333\" aria-label=\"4: NO ADD-ON\" aria-describedby=\"f-extras-5-4\">4<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"5\" data-x=\"88.750\" data-y=\"73.333\" aria-label=\"5: SETUP\" aria-describedby=\"f-extras-5-5\">5<\/button><\/div><\/div><\/div><figcaption>The loader with no game files found yet.<\/figcaption><ol class=\"mf-legend\" aria-label=\"What the numbers show\"><li data-n=\"1\" id=\"f-extras-5-1\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><div><b>File list<\/b> <span>One row per game file on the USB. Choose the base game, then an add-on if you want one.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"2\" id=\"f-extras-5-2\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><div><b>PREV and NEXT<\/b> <span>Pages through a long list.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"3\" id=\"f-extras-5-3\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><div><b>RESCAN USB<\/b> <span>Searches both USB ports again.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"4\" id=\"f-extras-5-4\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><div><b>NO ADD-ON<\/b> <span>Plays the base game with no add-on.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"5\" id=\"f-extras-5-5\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><div><b>SETUP<\/b> <span>Opens GAME SETUP.<\/span><\/div><\/li><\/ol><\/figure>\n<p>If the list says <strong>PUT .WAD FILES ON USB, THEN RESCAN<\/strong>, copy the files to the USB on a computer, put it back and push <strong>RESCAN USB<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<h4 id=\"m-my-house\" data-anchor=\"my-house\">My House <span class=\"tag tag--experimental\">experimental<\/span><\/h4>\n<p>My House is a Doom mod that needs the GZDoom engine. The MY HOUSE page checks for that engine and the files, but the classic Doom engine cannot load this mod, and the XZ Mods app no longer copies it to the USB.<\/p>\n<div class=\"mn\" data-iface=\"modern\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"My House\"><ol class=\"mn-scenes\"><li data-flow=\"my-house-setup\" data-video=\"assets/manual/nav/my-house-setup.mp4\" data-poster=\"assets/manual/nav/my-house-setup.webp\" data-w=\"1280\" data-h=\"480\" data-seconds=\"3.772\" data-title=\"My House\"><ol class=\"mn-steps\"><li data-t=\"500\">Press <span class=\"xzb\" data-key=\"menu\"><img class=\"xzb-g\" src=\"assets/buttons/menu.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"60.86\" height=\"32\"><span class=\"xzb-n\">MENU<\/span><\/span><\/li><li data-t=\"1000\">Tap <strong>EXTRAS<\/strong><\/li><li data-t=\"1520\">Tap <strong>GAMES<\/strong><\/li><li data-t=\"2040\">Tap <strong>MY HOUSE / SETUP<\/strong><\/li><li data-t=\"2560\">Turn <span class=\"xzb\" data-key=\"rotary\"><img class=\"xzb-g\" src=\"assets/buttons/rotary.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"33\" height=\"32\"><span class=\"xzb-n\">ROTARY SELECTOR<\/span><\/span> 1 click clockwise<\/li><\/ol><\/li><\/ol><\/div>\n<figure class=\"mf\" id=\"f-extras-6\"><div class=\"mf-frame\"><div class=\"mf-bar\"><span class=\"mf-label\">MY HOUSE<\/span><\/div><div class=\"mf-stage\"><img src=\"manual/shots/4b9aa257d0bae450.webp\" width=\"800\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"The My House check.\" data-iface=\"modern\"><img src=\"manual/shots/92641a7cf7731b12.webp\" width=\"800\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"The My House check.\" data-iface=\"classic\"><span class=\"mf-spot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/span><div class=\"mf-marks\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Numbered points on the picture\"><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"1\" data-x=\"52.500\" data-y=\"26.667\" aria-label=\"1: Steps\" aria-describedby=\"f-extras-6-1\">1<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"2\" data-x=\"49.375\" data-y=\"40.000\" aria-label=\"2: Limit\" aria-describedby=\"f-extras-6-2\">2<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"3\" data-x=\"87.500\" data-y=\"63.958\" aria-label=\"3: CHECK ENGINE\" aria-describedby=\"f-extras-6-3\">3<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"4\" data-x=\"55.000\" data-y=\"74.167\" aria-label=\"4: BACK TO GAMES\" aria-describedby=\"f-extras-6-4\">4<\/button><\/div><\/div><\/div><figcaption>The My House check.<\/figcaption><ol class=\"mf-legend\" aria-label=\"What the numbers show\"><li data-n=\"1\" id=\"f-extras-6-1\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><div><b>Steps<\/b> <span>Find the GZDoom engine, choose the Doom II data and MYHOUSE.PK3, check and start.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"2\" id=\"f-extras-6-2\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><div><b>Limit<\/b> <span>The classic Doom engine cannot load this mod.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"3\" id=\"f-extras-6-3\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><div><b>CHECK ENGINE<\/b> <span>Checks the engine and My House files on the USB.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"4\" id=\"f-extras-6-4\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><div><b>BACK TO GAMES<\/b> <span>Returns to GAMES.<\/span><\/div><\/li><\/ol><\/figure>\n<h3 id=\"m-usb-apps\" data-anchor=\"usb-apps\">USB apps <span class=\"tag tag--experimental\">experimental<\/span><\/h3>\n<p>USB APPS runs apps built with the XZ SDK from a USB. DJ controls keep working while an app runs.<\/p>\n<div class=\"mn\" data-iface=\"modern\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"USB apps\"><ol class=\"mn-scenes\"><li data-flow=\"apps-setup\" data-video=\"assets/manual/nav/apps-setup.mp4\" data-poster=\"assets/manual/nav/apps-setup.webp\" data-w=\"1280\" data-h=\"480\" data-seconds=\"3.772\" data-title=\"USB apps\"><ol class=\"mn-steps\"><li data-t=\"500\">Press <span class=\"xzb\" data-key=\"menu\"><img class=\"xzb-g\" src=\"assets/buttons/menu.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"60.86\" height=\"32\"><span class=\"xzb-n\">MENU<\/span><\/span><\/li><li data-t=\"1000\">Tap <strong>EXTRAS<\/strong><\/li><li data-t=\"1520\">Tap <strong>USB APPS<\/strong><\/li><li data-t=\"2040\">Tap <strong>SET UP APPS<\/strong><\/li><li data-t=\"2560\">Turn <span class=\"xzb\" data-key=\"rotary\"><img class=\"xzb-g\" src=\"assets/buttons/rotary.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"33\" height=\"32\"><span class=\"xzb-n\">ROTARY SELECTOR<\/span><\/span> 1 click clockwise<\/li><\/ol><\/li><\/ol><\/div>\n<figure class=\"mf\" id=\"f-extras-7\"><div class=\"mf-frame\"><div class=\"mf-bar\"><span class=\"mf-label\">MODS · USB APPS<\/span><\/div><div class=\"mf-stage\"><img src=\"manual/shots/b45b6936c114997d.webp\" width=\"800\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"USB APPS while the app manager is not running.\" data-iface=\"modern\"><img src=\"manual/shots/eed824baa2689ee2.webp\" width=\"800\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"USB APPS while the app manager is not running.\" data-iface=\"classic\"><span class=\"mf-spot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/span><div class=\"mf-marks\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Numbered points on the picture\"><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"1\" data-x=\"71.875\" data-y=\"14.167\" aria-label=\"1: AUTOLOAD\" aria-describedby=\"f-extras-7-1\">1<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"2\" data-x=\"35.625\" data-y=\"16.667\" aria-label=\"2: Status\" aria-describedby=\"f-extras-7-2\">2<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"3\" data-x=\"55.000\" data-y=\"32.708\" aria-label=\"3: Message\" aria-describedby=\"f-extras-7-3\">3<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"4\" data-x=\"21.875\" data-y=\"73.333\" aria-label=\"4: PREV and NEXT\" aria-describedby=\"f-extras-7-4\">4<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"5\" data-x=\"45.625\" data-y=\"73.333\" aria-label=\"5: RESCAN USB\" aria-describedby=\"f-extras-7-5\">5<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"6\" data-x=\"66.250\" data-y=\"73.333\" aria-label=\"6: SET UP APPS\" aria-describedby=\"f-extras-7-6\">6<\/button><\/div><\/div><\/div><figcaption>USB APPS while the app manager is not running.<\/figcaption><ol class=\"mf-legend\" aria-label=\"What the numbers show\"><li data-n=\"1\" id=\"f-extras-7-1\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><div><b>AUTOLOAD<\/b> <span>ON starts apps in the autoload folder when their USB goes in. OFF starts apps only when you run them.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"2\" id=\"f-extras-7-2\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><div><b>Status<\/b> <span>How many packages were found, or why there are none.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"3\" id=\"f-extras-7-3\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><div><b>Message<\/b> <span>The one thing to do next.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"4\" id=\"f-extras-7-4\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><div><b>PREV and NEXT<\/b> <span>Pages through the apps.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"5\" id=\"f-extras-7-5\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><div><b>RESCAN USB<\/b> <span>Searches the USB again for apps.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"6\" id=\"f-extras-7-6\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6<\/span><div><b>SET UP APPS<\/b> <span>A four-step guide from finding apps to a live test.<\/span><\/div><\/li><\/ol><\/figure>\n<p>Put apps on a USB in <code>VJ.Tools/XZ-SDK/Applications<\/code>. Apps in <code>VJ.Tools/XZ-SDK/Autoload<\/code> start on their own when <strong>AUTOLOAD<\/strong> is on.<\/p>\n<p>Each app row shows what kind of package it is and its state.<\/p>\n<div class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>State<\/th><th>Meaning<\/th><\/tr><\/thead><tbody><tr><td>RUNNING ON SCREEN<\/td><td>An app is showing on the player<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>RUNNING IN BACKGROUND<\/td><td>A service is running<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>APPLIED<\/td><td>A profile package is in use<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>FAILED<\/td><td>The app stopped. Push <strong>RUN AGAIN<\/strong><\/td><\/tr><tr><td>BLOCKED<\/td><td>The package cannot run. Push <strong>SET UP<\/strong> to see how to fix it<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>CHECKING<\/td><td>The app manager is still reading the package<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/div>\n<figure class=\"mf\" id=\"f-extras-8\"><div class=\"mf-frame\"><div class=\"mf-bar\"><span class=\"mf-label\">SET UP APPS<\/span><\/div><div class=\"mf-stage\"><img src=\"manual/shots/9cd566a1b44f716b.webp\" width=\"800\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Step 1 of SET UP APPS, with the app manager not running.\" data-iface=\"modern\"><img src=\"manual/shots/41637c8a3cb5c66b.webp\" width=\"800\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Step 1 of SET UP APPS, with the app manager not running.\" data-iface=\"classic\"><span class=\"mf-spot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/span><div class=\"mf-marks\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Numbered points on the picture\"><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"1\" data-x=\"49.375\" data-y=\"16.667\" aria-label=\"1: Step\" aria-describedby=\"f-extras-8-1\">1<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"2\" data-x=\"16.250\" data-y=\"23.958\" aria-label=\"2: Step tabs\" aria-describedby=\"f-extras-8-2\">2<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"3\" data-x=\"48.750\" data-y=\"31.875\" aria-label=\"3: Result\" aria-describedby=\"f-extras-8-3\">3<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"4\" data-x=\"60.625\" data-y=\"39.583\" aria-label=\"4: What to do\" aria-describedby=\"f-extras-8-4\">4<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"5\" data-x=\"37.500\" data-y=\"75.000\" aria-label=\"5: CHECK AGAIN\" aria-describedby=\"f-extras-8-5\">5<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"6\" data-x=\"71.875\" data-y=\"14.167\" aria-label=\"6: BACK TO APPS\" aria-describedby=\"f-extras-8-6\">6<\/button><\/div><\/div><\/div><figcaption>Step 1 of SET UP APPS, with the app manager not running.<\/figcaption><ol class=\"mf-legend\" aria-label=\"What the numbers show\"><li data-n=\"1\" id=\"f-extras-8-1\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><div><b>Step<\/b> <span>Which of the four steps you are on.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"2\" id=\"f-extras-8-2\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><div><b>Step tabs<\/b> <span>DETECT, FOLDERS, INSTALL, LIVE TEST. Tap one to jump to it.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"3\" id=\"f-extras-8-3\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><div><b>Result<\/b> <span>What this step found.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"4\" id=\"f-extras-8-4\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><div><b>What to do<\/b> <span>The one action that fixes it.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"5\" id=\"f-extras-8-5\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><div><b>CHECK AGAIN<\/b> <span>Runs this step again.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"6\" id=\"f-extras-8-6\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6<\/span><div><b>BACK TO APPS<\/b> <span>Returns to USB APPS.<\/span><\/div><\/li><\/ol><\/figure>\n<ol class=\"steps\"><li><strong>Detect.<\/strong> Finds the app manager and any apps on the USB.<\/li><li><strong>Folders.<\/strong> Choose <strong>START WHEN I TAP RUN<\/strong> or <strong>START ON USB INSERT<\/strong>.<\/li><li><strong>Install.<\/strong> Copy apps to the USB. The page shows the packer command for the desktop.<\/li><li><strong>Live test.<\/strong> Push <strong>RUN TEST APP<\/strong>. When it shows, push <strong>IT WORKS<\/strong>.<\/li><\/ol>\n<aside class=\"callout callout--note\"><b>Note<\/b><p><strong>APP MANAGER NOT RUNNING<\/strong> means XZ Mods did not start it. Switch the XZ off, start it again with its XZ Mods USB in, then push <strong>CHECK AGAIN<\/strong>.<\/p><\/aside>\n<h3 id=\"m-report-an-issue\" data-anchor=\"report-an-issue\">Report an issue<\/h3>\n<p>REPORT AN ISSUE sends the maintainer a problem, a question or an idea from the player. You say what it is about and, if you like, what happened. The player adds its own details. A topic and <strong>SEND<\/strong> take three presses.<\/p>\n<div class=\"mn\" data-iface=\"modern\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Report an issue\"><ol class=\"mn-scenes\"><li data-flow=\"report-issue\" data-video=\"assets/manual/nav/report-issue.mp4\" data-poster=\"assets/manual/nav/report-issue.webp\" data-w=\"1280\" data-h=\"480\" data-seconds=\"7.192\" data-title=\"Report an issue\"><ol class=\"mn-steps\"><li data-t=\"500\">Press <span class=\"xzb\" data-key=\"menu\"><img class=\"xzb-g\" src=\"assets/buttons/menu.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"60.86\" height=\"32\"><span class=\"xzb-n\">MENU<\/span><\/span><\/li><li data-t=\"1000\">Tap <strong>EXTRAS<\/strong><\/li><li data-t=\"1520\">Tap <strong>REPORT AN ISSUE<\/strong><\/li><li data-t=\"2040\">Turn <span class=\"xzb\" data-key=\"rotary\"><img class=\"xzb-g\" src=\"assets/buttons/rotary.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"33\" height=\"32\"><span class=\"xzb-n\">ROTARY SELECTOR<\/span><\/span> to <strong>SOMETHING ISN'T WORKING<\/strong> and push it<\/li><li data-t=\"5180\">Push <span class=\"xzb\" data-key=\"rotary\"><img class=\"xzb-g\" src=\"assets/buttons/rotary.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"33\" height=\"32\"><span class=\"xzb-n\">ROTARY SELECTOR<\/span><\/span> to choose <strong>SKIP, I'LL ADD IT ON MY COMPUTER<\/strong><\/li><\/ol><\/li><\/ol><\/div>\n<ol class=\"steps\"><li><strong>What's this about?<\/strong> Push one of the five topics, or <strong>NOT SURE<\/strong>.<\/li><li><strong>What happened?<\/strong> Type a few words, or push <strong>SKIP, I'LL ADD IT ON MY COMPUTER<\/strong>.<\/li><li><strong>Ready to send.<\/strong> Check the summary, then push <strong>SEND REPORT<\/strong>.<\/li><\/ol>\n<p>With the encoder, push three times: the first topic, SKIP, then SEND.<\/p>\n<figure class=\"mf\" id=\"f-extras-9\"><div class=\"mf-frame\"><div class=\"mf-bar\"><span class=\"mf-label\">REPORT AN ISSUE<\/span><\/div><div class=\"mf-stage\"><img src=\"manual/shots/1a061944ae68d51d.webp\" width=\"800\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Step 1: what the report is about.\" data-iface=\"modern\"><img src=\"manual/shots/8c2c8e69e779331b.webp\" width=\"800\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Step 1: what the report is about.\" data-iface=\"classic\"><span class=\"mf-spot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/span><div class=\"mf-marks\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Numbered points on the picture\"><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"1\" data-x=\"39.750\" data-y=\"13.333\" aria-label=\"1: WHAT&#x27;S THIS ABOUT?\" aria-describedby=\"f-extras-9-1\">1<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"2\" data-x=\"16.000\" data-y=\"29.167\" aria-label=\"2: Topics\" aria-describedby=\"f-extras-9-2\">2<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"3\" data-x=\"99.375\" data-y=\"71.875\" aria-label=\"3: NOT SURE\" aria-describedby=\"f-extras-9-3\">3<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"4\" data-x=\"78.500\" data-y=\"13.333\" aria-label=\"4: Steps\" aria-describedby=\"f-extras-9-4\">4<\/button><\/div><\/div><\/div><figcaption>Step 1: what the report is about.<\/figcaption><ol class=\"mf-legend\" aria-label=\"What the numbers show\"><li data-n=\"1\" id=\"f-extras-9-1\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><div><b>WHAT'S THIS ABOUT?<\/b> <span>One question. Each topic goes straight to the next step.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"2\" id=\"f-extras-9-2\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><div><b>Topics<\/b> <span>SOMETHING GOT WORSE, SOMETHING ISN'T WORKING, IT SHOULD WORK DIFFERENTLY, I HAVE A NEW IDEA and HOW DO I...?<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"3\" id=\"f-extras-9-3\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><div><b>NOT SURE<\/b> <span>Skips the question. The report still goes.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"4\" id=\"f-extras-9-4\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><div><b>Steps<\/b> <span>Where you are: step 1 of 3.<\/span><\/div><\/li><\/ol><\/figure>\n<figure class=\"mf\" id=\"f-extras-10\"><div class=\"mf-frame\"><div class=\"mf-bar\"><span class=\"mf-label\">WHAT HAPPENED?<\/span><\/div><div class=\"mf-stage\"><img src=\"manual/shots/8ab918dd4953dc4b.webp\" width=\"800\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Step 2, before you type. SKIP is lit: one push goes on without words.\" data-iface=\"modern\"><img src=\"manual/shots/ec1c82fdc7cc56f9.webp\" width=\"800\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Step 2, before you type. SKIP is lit: one push goes on without words.\" data-iface=\"classic\"><span class=\"mf-spot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/span><div class=\"mf-marks\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Numbered points on the picture\"><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"1\" data-x=\"46.000\" data-y=\"13.750\" aria-label=\"1: OPTIONAL\" aria-describedby=\"f-extras-10-1\">1<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"2\" data-x=\"14.750\" data-y=\"22.500\" aria-label=\"2: Your words\" aria-describedby=\"f-extras-10-2\">2<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"3\" data-x=\"14.750\" data-y=\"52.083\" aria-label=\"3: Keyboard\" aria-describedby=\"f-extras-10-3\">3<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"4\" data-x=\"14.750\" data-y=\"79.167\" aria-label=\"4: SKIP, I&#x27;LL ADD IT ON MY COMPUTER\" aria-describedby=\"f-extras-10-4\">4<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"5\" data-x=\"99.375\" data-y=\"79.167\" aria-label=\"5: NEXT\" aria-describedby=\"f-extras-10-5\">5<\/button><\/div><\/div><\/div><figcaption>Step 2, before you type. SKIP is lit: one push goes on without words.<\/figcaption><ol class=\"mf-legend\" aria-label=\"What the numbers show\"><li data-n=\"1\" id=\"f-extras-10-1\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><div><b>OPTIONAL<\/b> <span>You can send a report without typing anything.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"2\" id=\"f-extras-10-2\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><div><b>Your words<\/b> <span>Up to 280 characters. The count is on the right.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"3\" id=\"f-extras-10-3\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><div><b>Keyboard<\/b> <span>Turn and push the encoder, or tap the keys. The first letter is a capital.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"4\" id=\"f-extras-10-4\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><div><b>SKIP, I'LL ADD IT ON MY COMPUTER<\/b> <span>Goes on without words. Your computer asks what happened later.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"5\" id=\"f-extras-10-5\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><div><b>NEXT<\/b> <span>Goes on with what you typed.<\/span><\/div><\/li><\/ol><\/figure>\n<p>Once you type, <strong>NEXT<\/strong> is lit instead.<\/p>\n<div class=\"mg\" id=\"f-extras-11\" data-iface=\"modern\"><figure class=\"mg-item\"><button class=\"mg-shot\" type=\"button\" data-zoom=\"manual/shots/dbd87b0f117b6749.webp\" data-w=\"800\" data-h=\"480\" aria-label=\"Enlarge: WHAT HAPPENED? with words typed: NEXT is lit\"><img src=\"manual/shots/dbd87b0f117b6749.webp\" width=\"800\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\"><\/button><figcaption>WHAT HAPPENED? with words typed: NEXT is lit<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/div>\n<div class=\"mg\" id=\"f-extras-12\" data-iface=\"classic\"><figure class=\"mg-item\"><button class=\"mg-shot\" type=\"button\" data-zoom=\"manual/shots/6a4a3266c2820479.webp\" data-w=\"800\" data-h=\"480\" aria-label=\"Enlarge: WHAT HAPPENED? with words typed: NEXT is lit\"><img src=\"manual/shots/6a4a3266c2820479.webp\" width=\"800\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\"><\/button><figcaption>WHAT HAPPENED? with words typed: NEXT is lit<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/div>\n<figure class=\"mf\" id=\"f-extras-13\"><div class=\"mf-frame\"><div class=\"mf-bar\"><span class=\"mf-label\">READY TO SEND<\/span><\/div><div class=\"mf-stage\"><img src=\"manual/shots/2dd2d64ae39220ba.webp\" width=\"800\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Step 3: what will be sent.\" data-iface=\"modern\"><img src=\"manual/shots/5d0d02404119f26f.webp\" width=\"800\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"Step 3: what will be sent.\" data-iface=\"classic\"><span class=\"mf-spot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/span><div class=\"mf-marks\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Numbered points on the picture\"><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"1\" data-x=\"14.500\" data-y=\"20.417\" aria-label=\"1: ABOUT\" aria-describedby=\"f-extras-13-1\">1<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"2\" data-x=\"14.500\" data-y=\"31.250\" aria-label=\"2: WHAT HAPPENED\" aria-describedby=\"f-extras-13-2\">2<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"3\" data-x=\"14.500\" data-y=\"42.917\" aria-label=\"3: ALSO INCLUDED\" aria-describedby=\"f-extras-13-3\">3<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"4\" data-x=\"14.500\" data-y=\"54.583\" aria-label=\"4: IT GOES TO\" aria-describedby=\"f-extras-13-4\">4<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"5\" data-x=\"99.375\" data-y=\"22.500\" aria-label=\"5: CHANGE\" aria-describedby=\"f-extras-13-5\">5<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"6\" data-x=\"14.500\" data-y=\"77.083\" aria-label=\"6: SEND REPORT\" aria-describedby=\"f-extras-13-6\">6<\/button><\/div><\/div><\/div><figcaption>Step 3: what will be sent.<\/figcaption><ol class=\"mf-legend\" aria-label=\"What the numbers show\"><li data-n=\"1\" id=\"f-extras-13-1\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><div><b>ABOUT<\/b> <span>The topic you chose.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"2\" id=\"f-extras-13-2\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><div><b>WHAT HAPPENED<\/b> <span>Your words, or a note that you add them on your computer.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"3\" id=\"f-extras-13-3\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><div><b>ALSO INCLUDED<\/b> <span>Added by the player: the XZ Mods version, your settings, this stick's loader ID, the recent USB diary and the screen you were on. No music, track names or file names.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"4\" id=\"f-extras-13-4\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><div><b>IT GOES TO<\/b> <span>The XZ Mods inbox when the player is online, otherwise this stick.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"5\" id=\"f-extras-13-5\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><div><b>CHANGE<\/b> <span>Goes back to that step. Your words are kept.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"6\" id=\"f-extras-13-6\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6<\/span><div><b>SEND REPORT<\/b> <span>Sends it.<\/span><\/div><\/li><\/ol><\/figure>\n<p>BACK goes back a step. If you leave the page before sending, your words wait for you there.<\/p>\n<h4 id=\"m-after-you-send\" data-anchor=\"after-you-send\">After you send<\/h4>\n<p>The report goes one of three ways. Whichever it is, nothing is lost and you never type it again.<\/p>\n<div class=\"mn\" data-iface=\"modern\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"After you send\"><ol class=\"mn-scenes\"><li data-flow=\"report-edit-recovery\" data-video=\"assets/manual/nav/report-edit-recovery.mp4\" data-poster=\"assets/manual/nav/report-edit-recovery.webp\" data-w=\"1280\" data-h=\"480\" data-seconds=\"17.192\" data-title=\"After you send\"><ol class=\"mn-steps\"><li data-t=\"500\">Press <span class=\"xzb\" data-key=\"menu\"><img class=\"xzb-g\" src=\"assets/buttons/menu.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"60.86\" height=\"32\"><span class=\"xzb-n\">MENU<\/span><\/span><\/li><li data-t=\"1000\">Tap <strong>EXTRAS<\/strong><\/li><li data-t=\"1520\">Tap <strong>REPORT AN ISSUE<\/strong><\/li><li data-t=\"2040\">Turn <span class=\"xzb\" data-key=\"rotary\"><img class=\"xzb-g\" src=\"assets/buttons/rotary.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"33\" height=\"32\"><span class=\"xzb-n\">ROTARY SELECTOR<\/span><\/span> to <strong>SOMETHING ISN'T WORKING<\/strong> and push it<\/li><li data-t=\"5180\">Type <strong>test report<\/strong> on the screen keyboard<\/li><li data-t=\"11420\">Tap <strong>NEXT<\/strong><\/li><li data-t=\"11940\">Tap <strong>SEND REPORT<\/strong><\/li><li data-t=\"13060\">Tap <strong>EDIT REPORT<\/strong><\/li><li data-t=\"13580\">Tap <strong>CHANGE<\/strong><\/li><li data-t=\"14100\">Tap <strong>HOW DO I...?<\/strong><\/li><li data-t=\"14620\">Tap <strong>NEXT<\/strong><\/li><li data-t=\"15140\">Tap <strong>SEND REPORT<\/strong><\/li><li data-t=\"15660\">Tap <strong>DONE<\/strong><\/li><\/ol><\/li><\/ol><\/div>\n<div class=\"table\"><table><thead><tr><th>The screen says<\/th><th>What happened<\/th><th>What to do<\/th><\/tr><\/thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>SENT<\/strong> and a reference like <strong>R-4F7K-2M9Q<\/strong><\/td><td>It reached the XZ Mods inbox<\/td><td>Finish it on your computer: the XZ Mods app reminds you and shows the same reference<\/td><\/tr><tr><td><strong>SAVED ON THIS STICK<\/strong><\/td><td>The player is offline, its clock is not set, the loader is from an older XZ Mods app, or the inbox did not take it<\/td><td>Plug the stick into your computer. The XZ Mods app opens the report<\/td><\/tr><tr><td><strong>NOT SENT YET<\/strong><\/td><td>It could not be sent, and the stick could not take it<\/td><td>Do what the line says (put the stick back, use a writable stick, make room on it), then push <strong>TRY AGAIN<\/strong><\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/div>\n<div class=\"mg\" id=\"f-extras-14\" data-iface=\"modern\"><figure class=\"mg-item\"><button class=\"mg-shot\" type=\"button\" data-zoom=\"manual/shots/2db9b1b30dae10f3.webp\" data-w=\"800\" data-h=\"480\" aria-label=\"Enlarge: SENT: the reference to look for in the XZ Mods app\"><img src=\"manual/shots/2db9b1b30dae10f3.webp\" width=\"800\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\"><\/button><figcaption>SENT: the reference to look for in the XZ Mods app<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class=\"mg-item\"><button class=\"mg-shot\" type=\"button\" data-zoom=\"manual/shots/c4c8c6ca0dec1dc3.webp\" data-w=\"800\" data-h=\"480\" aria-label=\"Enlarge: SAVED ON THIS STICK\"><img src=\"manual/shots/c4c8c6ca0dec1dc3.webp\" width=\"800\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\"><\/button><figcaption>SAVED ON THIS STICK<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class=\"mg-item\"><button class=\"mg-shot\" type=\"button\" data-zoom=\"manual/shots/e507279e28f4dbec.webp\" data-w=\"800\" data-h=\"480\" aria-label=\"Enlarge: NOT SENT YET: the reason, TRY AGAIN and EDIT REPORT\"><img src=\"manual/shots/e507279e28f4dbec.webp\" width=\"800\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\"><\/button><figcaption>NOT SENT YET: the reason, TRY AGAIN and EDIT REPORT<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class=\"mg-item\"><button class=\"mg-shot\" type=\"button\" data-zoom=\"manual/shots/97c62710f776fa32.webp\" data-w=\"800\" data-h=\"480\" aria-label=\"Enlarge: While it sends. You can keep playing and close MODS\"><img src=\"manual/shots/97c62710f776fa32.webp\" width=\"800\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\"><\/button><figcaption>While it sends. You can keep playing and close MODS<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/div>\n<div class=\"mg\" id=\"f-extras-15\" data-iface=\"classic\"><figure class=\"mg-item\"><button class=\"mg-shot\" type=\"button\" data-zoom=\"manual/shots/56fd2f9d7daee644.webp\" data-w=\"800\" data-h=\"480\" aria-label=\"Enlarge: SENT: the reference to look for in the XZ Mods app\"><img src=\"manual/shots/56fd2f9d7daee644.webp\" width=\"800\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\"><\/button><figcaption>SENT: the reference to look for in the XZ Mods app<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class=\"mg-item\"><button class=\"mg-shot\" type=\"button\" data-zoom=\"manual/shots/d5c96c7bef4cfb4c.webp\" data-w=\"800\" data-h=\"480\" aria-label=\"Enlarge: SAVED ON THIS STICK\"><img src=\"manual/shots/d5c96c7bef4cfb4c.webp\" width=\"800\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\"><\/button><figcaption>SAVED ON THIS STICK<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class=\"mg-item\"><button class=\"mg-shot\" type=\"button\" data-zoom=\"manual/shots/0523f2de1b0c53c4.webp\" data-w=\"800\" data-h=\"480\" aria-label=\"Enlarge: NOT SENT YET: the reason, TRY AGAIN and EDIT REPORT\"><img src=\"manual/shots/0523f2de1b0c53c4.webp\" width=\"800\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\"><\/button><figcaption>NOT SENT YET: the reason, TRY AGAIN and EDIT REPORT<\/figcaption><\/figure><figure class=\"mg-item\"><button class=\"mg-shot\" type=\"button\" data-zoom=\"manual/shots/0351df5d0a207b33.webp\" data-w=\"800\" data-h=\"480\" aria-label=\"Enlarge: While it sends. You can keep playing and close MODS\"><img src=\"manual/shots/0351df5d0a207b33.webp\" width=\"800\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"\"><\/button><figcaption>While it sends. You can keep playing and close MODS<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/div>\n<p>A saved report waits in <code>VJ.Tools/XZ-Mods-reports/pending/<\/code> on the stick, up to 32 of them. The XZ Mods app sends it from there and moves it to <code>sent/<\/code>. <strong>TRY AGAIN<\/strong> sends the same report, so the maintainer gets it once.<\/p>\n<h4 id=\"m-report-an-error-from-the-dock\" data-anchor=\"report-an-error-from-the-dock\">Report an error from the dock<\/h4>\n<p>When an error shows in the dock's top row, <strong>REPORT THIS<\/strong> beside it opens REPORT AN ISSUE at <strong>WHAT HAPPENED?<\/strong> with SOMETHING ISN'T WORKING chosen. Push <strong>SKIP<\/strong> and <strong>SEND REPORT<\/strong>, and the error goes with it. Every report includes an error on screen, however you open it.<\/p>\n<div class=\"mn\" data-iface=\"modern\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Report an error from the dock\"><ol class=\"mn-scenes\"><li data-flow=\"report-dock-entry\" data-video=\"assets/manual/nav/report-dock-entry.mp4\" data-poster=\"assets/manual/nav/report-dock-entry.webp\" data-w=\"1280\" data-h=\"480\" data-seconds=\"3.572\" data-title=\"Report an error from the dock\"><ol class=\"mn-steps\"><li data-t=\"500\">Press <span class=\"xzb\" data-key=\"menu\"><img class=\"xzb-g\" src=\"assets/buttons/menu.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"60.86\" height=\"32\"><span class=\"xzb-n\">MENU<\/span><\/span><\/li><li data-t=\"1000\">Tap <strong>REPORT THIS<\/strong><\/li><li data-t=\"1520\">Tap <strong>SKIP, I'LL ADD IT ON MY COMPUTER<\/strong><\/li><li data-t=\"2040\">Tap <strong>SEND REPORT<\/strong><\/li><\/ol><\/li><\/ol><\/div>\n<figure class=\"mf\" id=\"f-extras-16\"><div class=\"mf-frame\"><div class=\"mf-bar\"><span class=\"mf-label\">REPORT THIS<\/span><\/div><div class=\"mf-stage\"><img src=\"manual/shots/ee7fb9c7394f693b.webp\" width=\"800\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"A player warning in the dock, here E-8307: USB ACCESS ERROR, with REPORT THIS.\" data-iface=\"modern\"><img src=\"manual/shots/609f67549ede6322.webp\" width=\"800\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"A player warning in the dock, here E-8307: USB ACCESS ERROR, with REPORT THIS.\" data-iface=\"classic\"><span class=\"mf-spot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/span><div class=\"mf-marks\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Numbered points on the picture\"><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"1\" data-x=\"63.750\" data-y=\"93.125\" aria-label=\"1: REPORT THIS\" aria-describedby=\"f-extras-16-1\">1<\/button><\/div><\/div><\/div><figcaption>A player warning in the dock, here E-8307: USB ACCESS ERROR, with REPORT THIS.<\/figcaption><ol class=\"mf-legend\" aria-label=\"What the numbers show\"><li data-n=\"1\" id=\"f-extras-16-1\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><div><b>REPORT THIS<\/b> <span>Opens REPORT AN ISSUE about this error. Touch only: with the encoder, open EXTRAS › REPORT AN ISSUE.<\/span><\/div><\/li><\/ol><\/figure>\n<figure class=\"mf\" id=\"f-extras-17\" data-iface=\"modern\"><div class=\"mf-frame\"><div class=\"mf-bar\"><span class=\"mf-label\">REPORT THIS<\/span><\/div><div class=\"mf-stage\"><img src=\"manual/shots/30f5703b907d9208.webp\" width=\"800\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"In MODERN a deck&#x27;s counter error keeps the dock&#x27;s top row, with REPORT THIS beside SHOW DECK.\"><span class=\"mf-spot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/span><div class=\"mf-marks\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Numbered points on the picture\"><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"1\" data-x=\"55.000\" data-y=\"93.125\" aria-label=\"1: REPORT THIS\" aria-describedby=\"f-extras-17-1\">1<\/button><\/div><\/div><\/div><figcaption>In MODERN a deck's counter error keeps the dock's top row, with REPORT THIS beside SHOW DECK.<\/figcaption><ol class=\"mf-legend\" aria-label=\"What the numbers show\"><li data-n=\"1\" id=\"f-extras-17-1\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><div><b>REPORT THIS<\/b> <span>Reports this error. SHOW DECK closes MODS onto the deck.<\/span><\/div><\/li><\/ol><\/figure>\n<h4 id=\"m-what-the-player-sends\" data-anchor=\"what-the-player-sends\">What the player sends<\/h4>\n<p>The report holds facts the player can check, never text read from its screens:<\/p>\n<ul><li>the topic and your words, if any;<\/li><li>the XZ Mods version and a fingerprint of your settings, with a few of them (stems, gate cue, interface, theme, deck view, browse preview);<\/li><li>the loader ID from ABOUT and the ID of the computer that made the loader, so the report reaches your own XZ Mods app;<\/li><li>the screen MODS was opened from (PLAY, BROWSE and so on), the interface, the deck view and the code of any error on screen;<\/li><li>known status codes from decks 3 and 4 and the player, and the recent entries of the USB diary on this stick.<\/li><\/ul>\n<p>It never holds music, track or playlist names, file names or network addresses. Only the maintainer reads it. You can also report from the XZ Mods app. See <a class=\"m-link\" href=\"#manual\" data-chapter=\"troubleshooting\">Messages and troubleshooting<\/a>.<\/p>\n<h3 id=\"m-language\" data-anchor=\"language\">Language<\/h3>\n<p>LANGUAGE sets the language of the MODS menu on the player. All 15 languages show in their own names. Tap one, or turn the encoder to it and push. The choice is saved on the USB with your other settings, and <span class=\"xzb\" data-key=\"back\"><img class=\"xzb-g\" src=\"assets/buttons/back.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"76.49\" height=\"32\"><span class=\"xzb-n\">BACK<\/span><\/span> returns to EXTRAS.<\/p>\n<figure class=\"mf\" id=\"f-extras-18\"><div class=\"mf-frame\"><div class=\"mf-bar\"><span class=\"mf-label\">MODS · LANGUAGE<\/span><\/div><div class=\"mf-stage\"><img src=\"manual/shots/d3874bc4cd415e1e.webp\" width=\"800\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"The LANGUAGE page with English chosen.\" data-iface=\"modern\"><img src=\"manual/shots/06a953f19e12e6fa.webp\" width=\"800\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"The LANGUAGE page with English chosen.\" data-iface=\"classic\"><span class=\"mf-spot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/span><div class=\"mf-marks\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Numbered points on the picture\"><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"1\" data-x=\"31.000\" data-y=\"17.500\" aria-label=\"1: Chosen language\" aria-describedby=\"f-extras-18-1\">1<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"2\" data-x=\"58.000\" data-y=\"50.000\" aria-label=\"2: Other languages\" aria-describedby=\"f-extras-18-2\">2<\/button><\/div><\/div><\/div><figcaption>The LANGUAGE page with English chosen.<\/figcaption><ol class=\"mf-legend\" aria-label=\"What the numbers show\"><li data-n=\"1\" id=\"f-extras-18-1\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><div><b>Chosen language<\/b> <span>The language the MODS menu uses now.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"2\" id=\"f-extras-18-2\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><div><b>Other languages<\/b> <span>Each one in its own name and script.<\/span><\/div><\/li><\/ol><\/figure>\n<p>The translations are machine-made and still being reviewed. Some lines stay in English, and track names, the player's own screens and the printed button names never change. The XZ Mods app has its own language choice; see <a class=\"m-link\" href=\"#manual\" data-chapter=\"desktop-app\" data-anchor=\"desktop-language\">Desktop language<\/a>.<\/p>\n<h3 id=\"m-about-xz-mods\" data-anchor=\"about-xz-mods\">About XZ Mods<\/h3>\n<div class=\"mn\" data-iface=\"modern\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"About XZ Mods\"><ol class=\"mn-scenes\"><li data-flow=\"about\" data-video=\"assets/manual/nav/about.mp4\" data-poster=\"assets/manual/nav/about.webp\" data-w=\"1280\" data-h=\"480\" data-seconds=\"3.452\" data-title=\"About XZ Mods\"><ol class=\"mn-steps\"><li data-t=\"500\">Press <span class=\"xzb\" data-key=\"menu\"><img class=\"xzb-g\" src=\"assets/buttons/menu.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"60.86\" height=\"32\"><span class=\"xzb-n\">MENU<\/span><\/span><\/li><li data-t=\"1000\">Tap <strong>EXTRAS<\/strong><\/li><li data-t=\"1520\">Tap <strong>ABOUT XZ MODS<\/strong><\/li><li data-t=\"2040\">Turn <span class=\"xzb\" data-key=\"rotary\"><img class=\"xzb-g\" src=\"assets/buttons/rotary.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"33\" height=\"32\"><span class=\"xzb-n\">ROTARY SELECTOR<\/span><\/span> 2 clicks clockwise<\/li><\/ol><\/li><\/ol><\/div>\n<figure class=\"mf\" id=\"f-extras-19\"><div class=\"mf-frame\"><div class=\"mf-bar\"><span class=\"mf-label\">ABOUT XZ MODS<\/span><\/div><div class=\"mf-stage\"><img src=\"manual/shots/b38d3e9040fadf8f.webp\" width=\"800\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"The About page with XZMODS.COM highlighted and its QR code shown.\" data-iface=\"modern\"><img src=\"manual/shots/b69c751ea8868c13.webp\" width=\"800\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" alt=\"The About page with XZMODS.COM highlighted and its QR code shown.\" data-iface=\"classic\"><span class=\"mf-spot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/span><div class=\"mf-marks\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Numbered points on the picture\"><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"1\" data-x=\"51.875\" data-y=\"20.625\" aria-label=\"1: Credits\" aria-describedby=\"f-extras-19-1\">1<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"2\" data-x=\"17.500\" data-y=\"41.667\" aria-label=\"2: Links\" aria-describedby=\"f-extras-19-2\">2<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"3\" data-x=\"70.625\" data-y=\"43.750\" aria-label=\"3: QR code\" aria-describedby=\"f-extras-19-3\">3<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"4\" data-x=\"85.625\" data-y=\"67.708\" aria-label=\"4: Address\" aria-describedby=\"f-extras-19-4\">4<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"5\" data-x=\"55.625\" data-y=\"76.250\" aria-label=\"5: Thanks\" aria-describedby=\"f-extras-19-5\">5<\/button><button class=\"mf-mark\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-n=\"6\" data-x=\"32.750\" data-y=\"29.167\" aria-label=\"6: Loader\" aria-describedby=\"f-extras-19-6\">6<\/button><\/div><\/div><\/div><figcaption>The About page with XZMODS.COM highlighted and its QR code shown.<\/figcaption><ol class=\"mf-legend\" aria-label=\"What the numbers show\"><li data-n=\"1\" id=\"f-extras-19-1\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">1<\/span><div><b>Credits<\/b> <span>Who made XZ Mods.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"2\" id=\"f-extras-19-2\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">2<\/span><div><b>Links<\/b> <span>XZMODS.COM, INSTAGRAM, BOOK OPTICMYSTIC, VJ.TOOLS, GITHUB / SOURCE, CREDITS / NOTICES and SUPPORT / CASH APP.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"3\" id=\"f-extras-19-3\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">3<\/span><div><b>QR code<\/b> <span>The highlighted link as a QR code. Scan it with your phone.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"4\" id=\"f-extras-19-4\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">4<\/span><div><b>Address<\/b> <span>The link the QR code opens.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"5\" id=\"f-extras-19-5\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">5<\/span><div><b>Thanks<\/b> <span>Thanks, and a reminder that XZ Mods is an independent project.<\/span><\/div><\/li><li data-n=\"6\" id=\"f-extras-19-6\"><span class=\"mf-chip\" aria-hidden=\"true\">6<\/span><div><b>Loader<\/b> <span>The ID of this stick's loader, written by the XZ Mods app. Reports from this stick carry it. An older loader shows <strong>Loader: not identified<\/strong> and can still report.<\/span><\/div><\/li><\/ol><\/figure>\n<p>Turn the encoder to a link, then push or tap it to show it as a QR code. Scan the code for <strong>CREDITS / NOTICES<\/strong> to read the full credits, licences and matching source. Support is voluntary. Every feature stays available without it.<\/p>";
